invariant: INV-25
file: x509.c
catches: x509strict
builds: bin/x509strict
reason: read_validity accepts bytes after notAfter inside the Validity
  SEQUENCE, so a certificate carrying a third Time, or one stray byte,
  parses and the two dates no longer fill the field. This is the ca
  mode's copy of the webpki bug inv05-webpki-validity-trailing-byte
  names; test/x509_exact_fill.h objects.

--- old
    return !v.err && rb_left(&v) == 0;
--- new
    return !v.err;
